ional structure and provides meaningful growth opportunities.\\n+\\n+Please provide your feedback through:\\n+- Direct comments to HR\\n+- Team discussions\\n+- One-on-one meetings with managers\\n+\\n+Together, we can build a career development framework that supports everyone's professional growth at TheAgentCompany.\\n+\", _diff_cache=None), CmdRunAction(command='\\n\\n\\n\\nwhich libreoffice || which soffice || echo \"LibreOffice not available\"\\n\\n\\n\\n', is_input=False, thought='Now I need to convert this text file to an ODT format and upload it to OwnCloud. Let me first check if we have tools to create ODT files:', blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content='LibreOffice not available', command='which libreoffice || which soffice || echo \"LibreOffice not available\"', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/outputs', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), CmdRunAction(command='\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n# Create a temporary directory for ODT structure\\nmkdir -p career_ladder_odt/META-INF\\nmkdir -p career_ladder_odt/Configurations2/images/Bitmaps\\nmkdir -p career_ladder_odt/Thumbnails\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n', is_input=False, thought=\"Since LibreOffice is not available, I'll create a simple ODT file manually by creating the necessary structure. ODT files are ZIP archives with specific XML files. Let me create the basic structure:\", blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), ErrorObservation(content='ERROR: Cannot execute multiple commands at once.\\nPlease run each command separately OR chain them into a single command via && or