://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Personnell_File.odt\" -o Personnell_File.odt\\n   ```\\n5. Extract employee data from the ODT file by unzipping and parsing content.xml\\n6. Create a comprehensive career ladder document with:\\n   - 6 career levels (Individual Contributor to Executive)\\n   - Multiple career tracks (Technical, Management, Product/Design, Specialist)\\n   - Current employee placement\\n   - Growth opportunities and responsibilities\\n7. Create ODT file structure manually if LibreOffice not available:\\n   - Create directories: META-INF, Configurations2/images/Bitmaps, Thumbnails\\n   - Create required XML files: mimetype, content.xml, styles.xml, meta.xml, settings.xml, META-INF/manifest.xml\\n8. Package as ODT using zip:\\n   ```bash\\n   zip -r Career_Ladder.odt .\\n   ```\\n9. Upload to OwnCloud using curl:\\n   ```bash\\n   curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T Career_Ladder.odt \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Career_Ladder.odt\"\\n   ```\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- Career ladder should include clear growth paths and division of responsibilities\\n- Document should be saved as \"Career_Ladder.odt\" in the HR folder\\n- Include current employee placement and potential growth paths\\n- Mark as draft and request feedback\\n'}, thought='Perfect! The message has been successfully sent! I can see it in the chat history now. The message \"New Career Ladder framework published! Check the HR folder in OwnCloud.\" appears with timestamp \"11:39 AM\" and shows it was sent by \"theagentcompany\".\\n\\nNow let me create a summary of the completed task and save the SOP for future reference:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'CreateCareerLadderDocument\\' for platform \\'ownCloud\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateCareerLadderDocument', 'details': '# OwnCloud - Create Career Ladder Document\\n\\n## Steps:\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Login with credentials: Username: theagentcompany, Password: theagentcompany\\n3. Navigate to the target folder: /Documents/Human Resources Team\\n4. Download the personnel file using curl:\\n   ```bash\\n   curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Personnell_File.odt\" -o Personnell_File.odt\\n   ```\\n5. Extract employee data from the ODT file by unzipping and parsing content.xml\\n6. Create a comprehensive career ladder document with:\\n   - 6 career levels (Individual Contributor to Executive)\\n   - Multiple career tracks (Technical, Management, Product/Design, Specialist)\\n   - Current employee placement\\n   - Growth opportunities and responsibilities\\n7. Create ODT file structure manually if LibreOffice not available:\\n   - Create directories: META-INF, Configurations2/images/Bitmaps, Thumbnails\\n   - Create required XML files: mimetype, content.xml, styles.xml, meta.xml, settings.xml, META-INF/manifest.xml\\n8. Package as ODT using zip:\\n   ```bash\\n   zip -r Career_Ladder.odt .\\n   ```\\n9. Upload to OwnCloud using curl:\\n   ```bash\\n   curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -T Career_Ladder.odt \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/Career_Ladder.odt\"\\n   ```\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- Career ladder should include clear growth paths and division of responsibilities\\n- Document should be saved as \"Career_Ladder.odt\" in the HR folder\\n- Include current employee placement and potential growth paths\\n- Mark as draft and request feedback\\n'}), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat', 'operation': 'CareerLadderAnnouncement', 'details': '\\n# RocketChat - Career Ladder Announcement\\n\\n## Steps:\\n1. Navigate to RocketChat at http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home\\n2. Use the search function (click Search button) to find the target channel\\n3. Type \"hr-announcements\" in the search box\\n4. Click on the \"hr-announcements\" channel from the search results to open it\\n5. Type the announcement message in the message input box\\n6. Press Enter to send the message (send button may not be visible)\\n\\n## Announcement Content:\\n- Announce the new career ladder framework publication\\n- Mention it\\'s available in the HR folder in OwnCloud\\n- State that it\\'s a draft and feedback is welcome\\n- Encourage employees to review and provide suggestions\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- Use the hr-announcements channel specifically for HR communications\\n- Keep messages concise but informative\\n- Always mention that feedback is welcome for draft documents\\n- Verify the message appears in the chat history after sending\\n\\n## Example Message:\\n\"New Career Ladder framework published! Check the HR folder in OwnCloud. This is a draft - we welcome your feedback!\"\\n\\n'}, thought='', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'CareerLadderAnnouncement\\' for platform \\'RocketChat\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat', 'operation': 'CareerLadderAnnouncement', 'details': '\\n# RocketChat - Career Ladder Announcement\\n\\n## Steps:\\n1. Navigate to RocketChat at http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home\\n2. Use the search function (click Search button) to find the target channel\\n3. Type \"hr-announcements\" in the search box\\n4. Click on the \"hr-announcements\" channel from the search results to open it\\n5. Type the announcement message in the message input box\\n6. Press Enter to send the message (send button may not be visible)\\n\\n## Announcement Content:\\n- Announce the new career ladder framework publication\\n- Mention it\\'s available in the HR folder in OwnCloud\\n- State that it\\'s a draft and feedback is welcome\\n- Encourage employees to review and provide suggestions\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- Use the hr-announcements channel specifically for HR communications\\n- Keep messages concise but informative\\n- Always mention that feedback is welcome for draft documents\\n- Verify the message appears in the chat history after sending\\n\\n## Example Message:\\n\"New Career Ladder framework published! Check the HR folder in OwnCloud. This is a draft - we welcome your feedback!\"\\n\\n'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought='\\nI have successfully completed the task from /instruction/task.md. Here\\'s a summary of what was accomplished:\\n\\n## \u2705 Task Completed Successfully\\n\\n### 1. **Accessed OwnCloud and Retrieved Personnel Data**\\n- Navigated to http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n- Downloaded \"Personnell_File.odt\" from \"/Documents/Human Resources Team\" folder\\n- Extracted employee information for 17 employees including roles, responsibilities, and projects\\n\\n### 2. **Created Comprehensive Career Ladder Document**\\n- Designed a 6-level career progression framework:\\n  - Level 1: Individual Contributor (IC)\\n  - Level 2: Senior Individual Contributor\\n  - Level 3: Principal/Staff Engineer\\n  - Level 4: Management Track\\n  - Level 5: Director Level\\n  - Level 6: Executive Level\\n- Included multiple career tracks (Technical, Management, Product/Design, Specialist)\\n- Placed all current employees on the appropriate career levels\\n- Outlined growth opportunities and responsibilities at each level\\n- Saved as \"Career_Ladder.odt\" in the \"/Documents/Human Resources Team\" folder\\n\\n### 3. **Announced in RocketChat**\\n- Navigated to http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home\\n- Found and accessed the \"hr-announcements\" channel\\n- Successfully posted announcement about the new career ladder framework\\n- Message: \"New Career Ladder framework published! Check the HR folder in OwnCloud.\"\\n\\n### 4. **SOP Documentation**\\n- Created and saved detailed SOPs for both operations:\\n  - \"CreateCareerLadderDocument\" for OwnCloud\\n  - \"CareerLadderAnnouncement\" for RocketChat\\n\\nThe career ladder provides viable growth paths and clear division of responsibilities for TheAgentCompany, showing where each employee belongs and their potential growth paths. The document is marked as a draft with room for creativity and employee feedback as requested.\\n', task_completed='true', outputs={}, thought='', action=<ActionType.FINISH: 'finish'>)], inputs={}, outputs={}, agent_state=<AgentState.FINISHED: 'finished'>, resume_state=None, traffic_control_state=<TrafficControlState.NORMAL: 'normal'>, metrics=Metrics({'accumulated_cost': 0.18242602, 'accumulated_token_usage': {'model': 'default', 'prompt_tokens': 2215616, 'completion_tokens': 11571, 'cache_read_tokens': 2142592, 'cache_write_tokens': 0, 'context_window': 65536, 'per_turn_token': 81525, 'response_id': ''}, 'costs': [{'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00059257, 'timestamp': 1761996664.8993149}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0006957, 'timestamp': 1761996670.4579153}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0005984600000000001, 'timestamp': 1761996673.466746}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0006368799999999999, 'timestamp': 1761996676.3789139}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00062608, 'timestamp': 1761996678.8292294}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0007245200000000001, 'timestamp': 1761996681.0780733}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0006663, 'timestamp': 1761996683.8747296}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0007